# Extra files to include in the sdist. The wheel is unaffected
# (wheel contents come from setuptools.packages.find + package_data).
#
# These files matter to people installing from source but not to
# people installing from the wheel:
# - examples/ is the runnable side-by-side port of the pre-refactor
#   script. Users pulling from source want it; wheel users will
#   typically read it on GitHub instead.
# - RELEASING.md is only useful to maintainers cutting new releases.

recursive-include examples *.py *.md
include RELEASING.md
include README.md
include LICENSE
